      "created_at": "2023-08-21T15:43:48.496Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Unfortunately, that doesn’t work. As a general rule to prevent awkward infinite loops, cards don’t trigger off themselves, which means that you can’t use the Friendly Fire damage to trigger Friendly Fire, even if you redirect it to someone else.</p>\n<p>You <em>can</em> use Friendly Fire and Fanatic for a little extra damage on every hit (in particular, it combos very nicely with the usually kind of meh Divine Focus, and I <em>think</em> it does some nonsense with a rapid-redirected Holy Nova, but I’d have to double-check that that works.)</p>",
